DrawingML: register the hyperlink-color namespace at runtime

Patch 0052 added tokens and handling but omitted NamespaceIds().
Register the URI so import dispatches hlinkClr to HyperLinkContext.
The existing five-color regression fails without this registration.

diff --git a/oox/source/core/xmlfilterbase.cxx b/oox/source/core/xmlfilterbase.cxx
